## Protein & Gene Expression Correlation QC

- [x] Implement function to calculate correlations between protein and gene expression levels.
  `checkFeatureCorrelation()`; `checkSampleIdentity()` uses them to find swapped samples.
- [x] Establish a null distribution comparison for correlation metrics.
  Permutation null (shuffled patient pairing) in `checkFeatureCorrelation()`.
- [x] Integrate gene mapping via UniProt.ws.
  `mapFeatures()` works with `UniProt.ws` or an `OrgDb` such as `org.Hs.eg.db`.

## Sex Verification QC

- [x] Incorporate sex quality control checks using gene expression data (based on Carmen's method).
  Implemented as `checkSex()`, using an XIST / Y-chromosome marker score
  calibrated on the reported sex (not Carmen's method, which was not documented).

